  "body": "Hi, \r\n For my application I am reading from a weighing scale connected to USB using RS232-USB converter. \r\nI am trying to read from a serial port, \r\nwhen I execute the following code , \r\nnavigator.serial.requestPort({  }) I get error \r\n\r\n**There was an error opening the serial port: DOMException: Failed to execute 'requestPort' on 'Serial': Must be handling a user gesture to show a permission request.**\r\n\r\n\r\nIt will work if it is part of a button click event.\r\n\r\nWould the seamless integration be possible? A serial port is connected once I log in and from any where in the application, I should be able to call my function getWeight() that will  read from the serialport\r\nregards,\r\nAkhila \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
